        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Located on the 2nd Floor on Horamavu Agara Road (beside Nayara Petrol Bunk), Aureva Dental is conveniently accessible for residents across North-East Bangalore:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth space-y-1.5 font-light">
          <li><strong>Hennur Bande &amp; Horamavu Agara Road:</strong> Approx. 2 minutes away depending on traffic.</li>
